        <p><seg source="#source-7868-7880">研匣書箋</seg><g ref="#gaiji-U-7F65-68-10" source="#source-7880-7963">罥</g><seg source="#source-7963-7975">網絲　　</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-7975-7999"><rb>硯匣</rb><rt>けんこう</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-7999-8002">　</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-8002-8026"><rb>書箋</rb><rt>しょせん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-8026-8029">　</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-8029-8050"><rb>網絲</rb><rt>もうし</rt></ruby><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-8050-8142"><rb><g ref="#gaiji-U-7F65-68-10" source="#source-8050-8133">罥</g></rb><rt>か</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-8142-8150">かる</seg></p>
