        <p><seg source="#source-8417-8444">情向新歓未肯痴　　</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-8444-8462"><rb>情</rb><rt>じょう</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-8462-8474">は新歓に</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-8474-8486"><rb>向</rb><rt>お</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-8486-8498">いて未だ</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-8498-8510"><rb>肯</rb><rt>あ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-8510-8530">へて痴ならず</seg></p>
